{"id":"635003","name":"腐竹拌黄瓜","author":"冬季心情","authorId":"8473848","desc":"","cover":"images/635003/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"腐竹","amount":"25g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"2瓣"},{"name":"薄荷","amount":"5g"},{"name":"辣椒红油","amount":"5g"},{"name":"味达美清香米醋","amount":"8g"},{"name":"味达美初榨原酿生抽","amount":"8g"},{"name":"味达美臻品蚝油","amount":"8g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"原料：腐竹（泡发），黄瓜，薄荷，蒜，生抽，米醋，蚝油。","img":"images/635003/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"腐竹用开水焯一下捞出过凉。","img":"images/635003/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"黄瓜洗净用刀拍散，切块，蒜和薄荷切碎。","img":"images/635003/step_3.jpeg"},{"step":4,"desc":"黄瓜和腐竹放盆中。","img":"images/635003/step_4.jpeg"},{"step":5,"desc":"调料汁：蒜中加入蚝油。","img":"images/635003/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入生抽。","img":"images/635003/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入米醋。","img":"images/635003/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加辣椒红油，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/635003/step_8.jpeg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入盆中。","img":"images/635003/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入薄荷，搅拌均匀装盘。","img":"images/635003/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"下饭又减脂的凉拌菜上桌。","img":"images/635003/step_11.jpeg"}],"tips":"腐竹要提前浸泡。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电>磁炉、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}